# Copy this file to public/CNAME and replace the line below with the
# client's real domain. Only do this at launch (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md,
# stage 2, step 3) — never before the client has signed off.
#
# The real public/CNAME file must contain nothing but the bare domain:
# one line, no comments, no protocol, no trailing slash. For example:
#
#   fadecitybarbershop.com
#
# For a client with no custom domain (served at username.github.io/repo
# instead), there is no CNAME file at all, ever — delete this file in
# that case rather than filling it in.
#
# public/CNAME does not exist in this repo before launch. Its absence
# is a deliberate signal of what stage the project is in (see
# docs/ENGINEERING.md, definition of done). Do not create the real file
# ahead of time "to save a step."
